{"content":[{"c":["ARGOB (P",{"c":["erson"],"sourceClass":"lc","t":"span"},")"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Individual supposedly killed with King Pekahiah of Israel in Pekah’s revolt (",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.15.25","r":"2Kgs.15.25","rawR":"2Kgs.15.25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.15.25","value":"2Kgs.15.25"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 15:25"},"). The early church father Jerome thought the name Argob (along with Arieh) referred to a place. Today some scholars think that Argob and Arieh may have been accidentally misplaced from a list of place names (",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.15.29","r":"2Kgs.15.29","rawR":"2Kgs.15.29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.15.29","value":"2Kgs.15.29"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 15:29"},") through scribal error."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"ArgobPerson","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 15:25","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.15.25","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.15.25","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.15.25"},{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 15:29","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.15.29","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.15.29","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.15.29"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"5be90742775b9adb07567e1303eb0680f7da86378a7f272e3c8f41e770fdb47d","sourceItemName":"ArgobPerson","sourceItemOrder":471,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"ArgobPerson","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Argob (Person)","title":"Argob (Person)","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}